<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/2/eng@/~cl_36__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "in subsection (1), by substituting for the proviso the following proviso: “Provided that— (a) where the Minister is satisfied that the company was engaged in an activity or had otherwise incurred capital expenditure in relation thereto, from a date prior to the date from which the activity was deemed as a promoted activity under section 4, the approval may be granted retrospectively from a date not earlier than the date from which the company has been engaged in that activity or the capital expenditure had been incurred in relation thereto; and (b) no approval shall be granted retrospectively under subsection (1) or under the foregoing proviso from a date which is earlier than three years from the date the application under subsection 26F(1) is received by the Minister.”;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/2/eng@> .
